{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Ex8: Adaptive Exponential IF\"\n",
        "description: \"AdEx integrate-and-fire neuron with adaptation current — bursting variant\"\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## Model: AdEx (adExIaFCell)\n",
        "\n",
        "The Adaptive Exponential Integrate-and-Fire model [@Brette2005]:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$C\\frac{dv}{dt} = -g_L(v - E_L) + g_L \\Delta_T \\exp\\!\\left(\\frac{v - V_T}{\\Delta_T}\\right) - w + I_{\\text{ext}}$$\n",
        "$$\\tau_w\\frac{dw}{dt} = a(v - E_L) - w$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Spike event: if $v > \\text{thresh}$, then $v \\leftarrow \\text{reset}$, $w \\leftarrow w + b$.\n",
        "\n",
        "The NeuroML example includes four variants (burst2, burst4, burstChaos, rebound).\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1. Define in TVBO (bursting variant)"
      ],
      "id": "6ffdfeb8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "from tvbo import SimulationExperiment\n",
        "\n",
        "exp = SimulationExperiment.from_string(\"\"\"\n",
        "label: \"NeuroML Ex8: AdEx (bursting)\"\n",
        "dynamics:\n",
        "  name: AdaptiveExponentialIF\n",
        "  parameters:\n",
        "    C:      { value: 281.0,  description: \"Capacitance (pF)\" }\n",
        "    gL:     { value: 30.0,   description: \"Leak conductance (nS)\" }\n",
        "    EL:     { value: -70.6,  description: \"Leak reversal (mV)\" }\n",
        "    VT:     { value: -50.4 }\n",
        "    thresh: { value: -40.4 }\n",
        "    reset:  { value: -48.5 }\n",
        "    delT:   { value: 2.0 }\n",
        "    tauw:   { value: 40.0 }\n",
        "    a:      { value: 4.0,    description: \"Subthreshold adaptation (nS)\" }\n",
        "    b:      { value: 80.0,   description: \"Spike-triggered adaptation (pA, = 0.08 nA)\" }\n",
        "    refract: { value: 0.0, unit: ms, description: \"Refractory period\" }\n",
        "  derived_variables:\n",
        "    I_ext:\n",
        "      equation:\n",
        "        rhs: \"800.0\"\n",
        "      description: \"Constant current 0.8 nA = 800 pA (pulseGen1: delay=0, duration=2000ms)\"\n",
        "  state_variables:\n",
        "    v:\n",
        "      equation:\n",
        "        rhs: \"(-gL*(v - EL) + gL*delT*exp((v - VT)/delT) - w + I_ext) / C\"\n",
        "      initial_value: -70.6\n",
        "      variable_of_interest: true\n",
        "    w:\n",
        "      equation:\n",
        "        rhs: \"(a*(v - EL) - w) / tauw\"\n",
        "      initial_value: 0.0\n",
        "  events:\n",
        "    spike:\n",
        "      condition: { rhs: \"v > thresh\" }\n",
        "      affect:    { rhs: \"v = reset; w = w + b\" }\n",
        "network:\n",
        "  number_of_nodes: 1\n",
        "integration:\n",
        "  method: euler\n",
        "  step_size: 0.025\n",
        "  duration: 300.0\n",
        "  time_scale: ms\n",
        "\"\"\")\n",
        "print(f\"Model: {exp.dynamics.name}, SVs: {list(exp.dynamics.state_variables.keys())}\")"
      ],
      "id": "d22edc9b",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 2. Render LEMS XML"
      ],
      "id": "ae5baed6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "xml = exp.render(\"lems\")\n",
        "print(xml[:1500])"
      ],
      "id": "8c0daeab",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 3. Run Reference"
      ],
      "id": "755efc5a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import sys, os\n",
        "sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(\".\")))\n",
        "from _nml_helpers import run_lems_example\n",
        "\n",
        "ref_outputs = run_lems_example(\"LEMS_NML2_Ex8_AdEx.xml\")\n",
        "for name, arr in ref_outputs.items():\n",
        "    print(f\"  {name}: shape={arr.shape}\")"
      ],
      "id": "39923be5",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 4. Run TVBO"
      ],
      "id": "33884bd6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "\n",
        "result = exp.run(\"neuroml\")\n",
        "da = result.integration.data\n",
        "tvbo_arr = np.column_stack([da.coords['time'].values, da.values])\n",
        "print(f\"TVBO: shape={tvbo_arr.shape}\")"
      ],
      "id": "19d4bd53",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 5. Comparison\n",
        "\n",
        "The NeuroML example has 4 cells. We compare the burst2 variant (first column):"
      ],
      "id": "aad26dd6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "from _nml_helpers import compare_traces, plot_comparison\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "\n",
        "ref_arr = list(ref_outputs.values())[0]\n",
        "# First data column should be adExBurst2/v\n",
        "ref_v = ref_arr[:, [0, 1]]\n",
        "tvbo_v = tvbo_arr[:, [0, 1]]\n",
        "\n",
        "compare_traces(ref_v, tvbo_v, ref_cols=['time', 'v'], tvbo_cols=['time', 'v'])\n",
        "\n",
        "plot_comparison(\n",
        "    ref_v, tvbo_v,\n",
        "    ref_cols=['time', 'v'], tvbo_cols=['time', 'v'],\n",
        "    title=\"Ex8: AdEx (bursting) — NeuroML vs TVBO\",\n",
        ")"
      ],
      "id": "fad9c060",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### All AdEx Variants (NeuroML reference)"
      ],
      "id": "1783e1b8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "\n",
        "fig, axes = plt.subplots(4, 1, figsize=(10, 10), sharex=True)\n",
        "labels = ['Burst2', 'Burst4', 'BurstChaos', 'Rebound']\n",
        "t_ref = ref_arr[:, 0] * 1000  # ms\n",
        "for i in range(min(4, ref_arr.shape[1]-1)):\n",
        "    axes[i].plot(t_ref, ref_arr[:, i+1] * 1000, color='C0')\n",
        "    axes[i].set_ylabel('v (mV)')\n",
        "    axes[i].set_title(labels[i] if i < len(labels) else f'col {i+1}')\n",
        "    axes[i].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
        "axes[-1].set_xlabel(\"Time (ms)\")\n",
        "fig.suptitle(\"Ex8: All AdEx Variants (NeuroML reference)\", fontsize=13)\n",
        "fig.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "id": "09c8caea",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    }
  ],
